    "enstrophy_budget": "J_A = lim_(r up to b_A) integral_0^r Y(t)^2 dt",
    "gauge": "L_A^4 = 4 nu J_A = 64 pi^4 nu B_A",
    "integral_convention": "Extended nonnegative improper integral over the complete endpoint interval; no value at a terminal b_A is assumed.",
    "fourier_convention": "exp(-2 pi i x dot xi); gradient symbol 2 pi i xi"
  },
  "proved_b_tier": [
    "Concrete projections are orthogonal, resolve the identity, preserve real solenoidal H1 fields, and commute with weak derivatives.",
    "J_6,A <= J_A <= 6 J_6,A and 4 nu J_6,A <= L_A^4 <= 24 nu J_6,A.",
    "a belongs to C^A_nu iff J_6,A < infinity iff T_max(a,nu)=infinity.",
    "Class sublevels L_A<=m increase and their union is C^A_nu.",
